  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b><a id="business" title="business" href="#"></a>ITEM 1. DESCRIPTION OF BUSINESS</b></p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <div style="text-align: center;">
   <img alt="ycbd_10klogo.jpg" src="ycbd_10klogo.jpg"/></div>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b>Our Company</b></p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">General</span></i></b></p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">cbdMD, Inc. is a consumer wellness company focused on the development, manufacturing, marketing, and sale of supplement brands powered by natural compounds.&#160; The majority of our products are anchored by hemp-derived cannabinoids, including broad-spectrum and full-spectrum CBD formulations, hemp-derived Delta-9 THC products (where permitted by law), and a range of functional products designed to address key wellness needs such as sleep, recovery, mood, discomfort, mobility, cognitive function, and stress management. Our approach centers on combining scientific rigor with high manufacturing standards to produce consistent, safe, and reliable products that meet both consumer expectations and evolving regulatory requirements.</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">We operate a multi-brand portfolio anchored by our flagship cbdMD&#174; line, which offers oils, gummies, capsules, soft-gels, topicals, functional formulations, and hemp-derived compliant Delta-9 THC products. Complementing this portfolio is Paw CBD&#174;, our dedicated pet-wellness brand, which provides tinctures, chews, and topicals for dogs and cats and reflects our long-standing emphasis on safety and quality in the animal health category.</p>
  <div style="text-align: center;">
   &#160;
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center;">
