     <td style="width: auto; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">International Expansion:</span></i>&#160;We continue to explore sales in markets outside of the United States. We generally partner with local wholesalers<i> </i>and local legal counsel who can help navigate the laws and regulatory requirements within their jurisdiction. We continue to pursue key wholesale accounts in a number of international markets and are gaining market share in Central and South America through our sanitary registration approvals.</td>
