  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b>Intellectual property </b></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">We hold a portfolio of U.S. trademark applications which are held for current and future product offerings and extended branding capability. The portfolio, includes but is not limited to, the trademarks set forth below:</p>
