  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS </b></p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>FOR THE YEAR ENDED<span style="text-transform:uppercase;"> September 30, 2025 and 2024</span></b></p>
