   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The Company had <em style="font: inherit;">no</em> warrant transactions during the <em style="font: inherit;">twelve</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> September 30, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024.</em></p>
