   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">As of <em style="font: inherit;"> September 30, 2025, </em>there was <ix:nonFraction id="c138971915" contextRef="i_2025-09-30_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedStockOptions" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">no</ix:nonFraction>&#160;unrecognized compensation cost related to non-vested stock options which all are fully vested.</p>
